Package: com.wifitether
Name: WiFi Tether
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Section: Networking
Depends: firmware (>= 15.0)
Recommends: python3
Maintainer: WiFi Tether
Author: WiFi Tether
Description: Share the iPhone's Wi-Fi connection with a computer over USB, through the iPhone's VPN when one is connected. Needs Personal Hotspot to be available (for example with the Share tweak). python3 is only used to restart a VPN that iOS stopped.
